      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Essentially it's asking for VRChat to have the basic stuff you see in any good texting platform ;p\n\nRecently had a great situation where I'd like to have an un-joinable DnD status... because a friend invited me to a lewd world. I hella wouldn't wanna let half my friends list join on that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
